rt, changed boot identity independently corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered service/data behavior. Only minor temporary test-file residue affects operational hygiene.","limitations":["The confinement behavior test targeted one known host file through one parent-traversal form rather than exhaustively probing every possible escape path; the chroot configuration provides coherent supporting evidence.","The failed initial client test in cmd-47a691e0642f422b produced no captured output, so the trace cannot prove whether any of its intended temporary-file cleanup or transfer operations executed.","The temporary-file lifecycle inventory is bounded to /tmp and therefore cannot establish the absence of residue elsewhere."]}
